      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We describe a previously unreported association between hyoscine hydrobromide and severe oesophagitis, with ulceration visible almost to the submucosa in the distal oesophagus. The condition resolved with cessation of tablets and 2 months' treatment with a proton-pump inhibitor."},
